  "steps": [
    "In a Pan, add very little olive oil. Sauté garlic and onion until golden brown. Then add the tomatoes. On the side, roast a bell pepper until charred and then scrap off the black parts.",
    "Add some salt and let the tomatoes cook well for 8-10 mins on slow- mid flame.",
    "Once the tomatoes are all mushy, blend this mixture with cashews, roasted bell pepper, paneer, and some water. Make a smooth paste.",
    "Add 1 tsp of chilli oil in a pan and then goes in this gravy that we blended.",
    "Add in the seasonings mentioned along with some ketchup.",
    "Let it cook well for 3-4 mins and add the pasta. Mix it all well and add the basil.",
    "Cover and cook on slow flame for 5 mins and its ready to serve."
  ],
